e": 0.46681827306747437}, {"doc_id": "P02", "title": "改签规则", "source": "data/policies.md#P02", "version": "d5926ccfe3981a69", "chunk_id": "P02-0000-ee28e78d13a2", "content": "开车前 48 小时以上可改签预售期内任意车次；开车前 48 小时以内可改签开车前的其他车次，也可改签开车后至当日 24:00 之间的车次。每张票仅可改签一次，改签后不退。", "score": 0.3589398264884949, "keyword_score": 0.23408229439226114, "rank": 9, "vector_score": 0.3589398264884949}, {"doc_id": "P10", "title": "实名与身份核验", "source": "data/policies.md#P10", "version": "8b2a80eb3605dca0", "chunk_id": "P10-0000-d31bb6d46837", "content": "购票实行实名制，乘车人须与票面信息一致；一个有效身份证件同一乘车日期同一车次仅可购买一张车票。", "score": 0.14002800840280097, "keyword_score": 0.14002800840280097, "rank": 8}, {"doc_id": "P05", "title": "学生票", "source": "data/policies.md#P05", "version": "def9fcf8b2b8e173", "chunk_id": "P05-0000-2ad89d5c523b", "content": "全日制在校学生每年可购买 4 次学生票，仅限二等座，按公布票价 75% 计算，寒暑假及家庭居住地至学校所在地之间有效。", "score": 0.1386750490563073, "keyword_score": 0.1386750490563073, "rank": 9}, {"doc_id": "P06", "title": "行李规定", "source": "data/policies.md#P06", "version": "1e1fd8d51d3f9486", "chunk_id": "P06-0000-2705abb94023", "content": "高铁成人免费携带品重量 20 千克，儿童 10 千克；每件物品长宽高之和不超过 160 厘米。超重部分按每千克 5 元补收运费。", "score": 0.1386750490563073, "keyword_score": 0.1386750490563073, "rank": 10}, {"doc_id": "P14", "title": "模拟候补边界", "source": "data/policies.md#P14", "version": "f4285c57defe97e1", "chunk_id": "P14-0000-80089e9f49a8", "content": "候补工具只返回监控任务凭据，不执行后台轮询、不承诺兑现，也不扣款。只有数据库中存在且当前无票的班次可以提交监控。", "score": 0.47509294748306274, "keyword_score": 0.13245323570650439, "rank": 5, "vector_score": 0.47509294748306274}, {"doc_id": "P09", "title": "机票退改规则", "source": "data/policies.md#P09", "version": "f31cd4160b93abb5", "chunk_id": "P09-0000-799e4c5fd057", "content": "机票经济舱起飞前 24 小时以上退票收取票面价 10%，24 小时内收取 30%；特价舱位（折扣低于 4 折）不支持退票，仅退机场建设费与燃油附加费。", "score": 0.1270001270001905, "keyword_score": 0.1270001270001905, "rank": 12}, {"source": "data/policies.md#P08", "version": "e8159a7e61371bf7", "title": "候补与余票释放", "doc_id": "P08", "chunk_id": "P08-0000-d1134f07d8dc", "content": "无票时可提交候补订单，系统按提交顺序自动兑现；其他旅客退票产生的余票优先分配给候补队列，候补订单有效期至开车前 2 小时。", "score": 0.4924817681312561, "vector_score": 0.4924817681312561, "rank": 4}, {"source": "data/policies.md#P07", "version": "2c734d1ca6e68b07", "chunk_id": "P07-0000-ef524fb2b645", "doc_id": "P07", "title": "报销凭证", "content": "乘车之日起 180 日内可在车站窗口或自助机打印报销凭证，仅可打印一次；已打印报销凭证的车票退票时需先交回凭证。", "score": 0.3894672393798828, "vector_score": 0.3894672393798828, "rank": 7}, {"doc_id": "P01", "source": "data/policies.md#P01", "version": "645904208717fad9", "title": "退票手续费阶梯", "chunk_id": "P01-0000-7e17c7d453fc", "content": "开车前 48 小时以上退票，收取票价 5% 手续费；开车前 24 至 48 小时退票，收取 10%；开车前不足 24 小时退票，收取 20%。已取报销凭证或已改签的车票不退。", "score": 0.356683611869812, "vector_score": 0.356683611869812, "rank": 10}], "rejections": [{"doc_id": "P12", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.5506129264831543}, {"doc_id": "P04", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.5252257314388902}, {"doc_id": "P03", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.3871504068374634}, {"doc_id": "P15", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.5160186886787415}, {"doc_id": "P13", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.46681827306747437}, {"doc_id": "P02", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.3589398264884949}, {"doc_id": "P10", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.14002800840280097}, {"doc_id": "P05", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.1386750490563073}, {"doc_id": "P06", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.1386750490563073}, {"doc_id": "P14", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.47509294748306274}, {"doc_id": "P09", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.1270001270001905}, {"doc_id": "P08", "reason": "policy_subject_or_transport_mismatch", "score": 0.4924817681312561}, {"doc_id": "P07", "reason": "po